# The policy judges the stored body before the upcast, so a migration aborts on
# a value it could migrate and that the policy accepts once upcast.
MODULE: AbortLeavesDataUntouchedValidatesStored
TARGET: AbortLeavesDataUntouched
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: validation runs before the upcast instead of after it
PERTURBS: MigrateStep

--- FIND
       IF m = Stuck \/ Rejected(m, migT)
--- REPLACE
       IF m = Stuck \/ Rejected(data[k], migT)
--- END